# Role/topic routing for the granular rule files at the reactor root.
#
# One role, matched by classes in TWO different modules (core and app). Both resolve the same
# output path - .claude/rules/reactor-spine.md and the same name under every other granular
# directory - which is the layout of issue #365, where each module's compile replaced the shared
# file with only its own classes and the sibling's guardrails vanished. CI asserts both survive.
#
# platform/ is deliberately outside the glob, so its classes keep per-class rule files and both
# paths stay covered by the same fixture.
reactor-spine = **/gmm/core/**, **/gmm/app/**
